# After `summarize`, only its output columns exist.
mode: check
show: schema
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, customerId: string, amount: real, qty: long, timestamp: datetime)
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId | where amount > 1
---- expected
error[DS1001]: unknown column `amount`
  --> query:1:73
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId | where amount > 1
  |                                                                         ^^^^^^ no column named `amount` here
  |
  = note: columns available at this point: customerId, total

query 1 columns:
  customerId: string
  total: real
